#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of AI skills for Qiskit quantum computing workflows."
msgstr "Aperçu des compétences IA pour les workflows de calcul quantique Qiskit."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills"
msgstr "Compétences IA Qiskit"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit AI skills {#qiskit-ai-skills}"
msgstr "Compétences IA Qiskit {#qiskit-ai-skills}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Qiskit AI skills repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) has a set of skills that you can use with AI assistants, such as Bob, Claude, or ChatGPT. An AI skill is a reusable set of instructions that teaches the assistant how to complete a specific task.  Skills can help save time and ensure that repeatable tasks are done consistently and correctly.  \n"
msgstr "Le [dépôt des compétences IA Qiskit](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) contient un ensemble de compétences que tu peux utiliser avec des assistants IA, tels que Bob, Claude ou ChatGPT. Une compétence IA est un ensemble réutilisable d'instructions qui apprend à l'assistant comment accomplir une tâche spécifique.  Les compétences peuvent aider à gagner du temps et à garantir que les tâches répétitives sont effectuées de manière cohérente et correcte.  \n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a Qiskit AI skill, follow the instructions for your AI assistant.  In general, you just need to give the skill to the assistant, then tell it where to apply the skill.\n"
msgstr "Pour utiliser une compétence IA Qiskit, suis les instructions de ton assistant IA.  En général, tu dois simplement donner la compétence à l'assistant, puis lui indiquer où l'appliquer.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation {#installation}"
msgstr "Installation {#installation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These skills follow the [Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io/) standard and can\n"
"be installed into compatible AI coding agents using the [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills), through\n"
"native agent plugin marketplaces, or by cloning the repository.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ces skills suivent le standard [Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io/) et peuvent\n"
"être installés dans des agents de programmation IA compatibles à l'aide de la [CLI skills](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills), via\n"
"des places de marché de plugins d'agents natives, ou en clonant le dépôt.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start {#quick-start}"
msgstr "Démarrage rapide {#quick-start}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The easiest way to install is with the [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills):\n"
msgstr "Le moyen le plus simple d'installer est d'utiliser la [CLI skills](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This will prompt you to pick which agent(s) to install for and whether to install globally or just for the current project.\n"
msgstr "Elle te demandera pour quel(s) agent(s) installer, et s'il faut installer globalement ou seulement pour le projet courant.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Install a specific skill:**\n"
msgstr "**Installer un skill spécifique :**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Keep installed skills current:**\n"
msgstr "**Garder les skills installés à jour :**\n"

