#, no-wrap
msgid "Claude Code {#claude-code}"
msgstr "Claude Code {#claude-code}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install using the [plugin marketplace](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/discover-plugins#add-from-github):\n"
msgstr "Installe avec la [place de marché de plugins](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/discover-plugins#add-from-github) :\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Codex {#codex}"
msgstr "Codex {#codex}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cursor {#cursor}"
msgstr "Cursor {#cursor}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from the Cursor marketplace if available, or use the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent cursor`. See [Cursor plugins docs](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Installe depuis la place de marché de Cursor si elle est disponible, ou utilise la [CLI Skills](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) ci-dessus avec `--agent cursor`. Consulte la [documentation des plugins Cursor](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) pour plus d'informations.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"
msgstr "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bob has no plugin/marketplace step — it reads `SKILL.md` files directly from `.bob/skills/` in a cloned project. The repository symlinks the skills to `.bob/skills/<name>`  so cloning the repo is sufficient.\n"
msgstr "Bob n'a pas d'étape de plugin/place de marché : il lit directement les fichiers `SKILL.md` depuis `.bob/skills/` dans un projet cloné. Le dépôt relie les skills par des liens symboliques à `.bob/skills/<name>`  ; cloner le dépôt suffit donc.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also install with the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent bob`.\n"
msgstr "Tu peux aussi installer avec la [CLI Skills](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) ci-dessus avec `--agent bob`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone / Copy {#clone--copy}"
msgstr "Cloner / Copier {#clone--copy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your agent does not support a native plugin or the skills CLI, clone this repo and copy the desired skill directory to the agent's supported skill directory:\n"
msgstr "Si ton agent ne prend pas en charge un plugin natif ou la CLI skills, clone ce dépôt et copie le répertoire du skill souhaité dans le répertoire de skills pris en charge par l'agent :\n"

